{"id":"7ebbc212e82e7872","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-mad-family.md","title":"MAD Family","display":"df-mad-family — MAD Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-mad-family","aliases":["58-df-mad-family","58-df-zfc-mad-family","58-df-zfc-comb5-mad-family","58-df-zfc-comb8-mad-family"],"display":"df-mad-family — MAD Family","depends_on":["[[58-df-almost-disjoint]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-mad-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-mad-family</span><span>58-df-zfc-mad-family</span><span>58-df-zfc-comb5-mad-family</span><span>58-df-zfc-comb8-mad-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-mad-family — MAD Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"168a305dd3d267bf\" href=\"?note=168a305dd3d267bf\" title=\"58-df-almost-disjoint\">58-df-almost-disjoint</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal A\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AlmostDisjoint}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{AlmostDisjoint}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"168a305dd3d267bf\" href=\"?note=168a305dd3d267bf\" title=\"58-df-almost-disjoint\">58-df-almost-disjoint</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MADFamily}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{MADFamily}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mad-family}\\vdash\\mathrm{MADFamily}_S(\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal A\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\neq B\\to\\mathrm{AlmostDisjoint}_S(A,B))\\land\\forall X\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\exists A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\neg\\mathrm{AlmostDisjoint}_S(A,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mad-family}\\vdash\\mathrm{MADFamily}_S(\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal A\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\neq B\\to\\mathrm{AlmostDisjoint}_S(A,B))\\land\\forall X\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\exists A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\neg\\mathrm{AlmostDisjoint}_S(A,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>MAD families are maximal almost disjoint families.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-comb5-mad-family</code> and <code>58-df-zfc-comb8-mad-family</code> are merged here.</li>\n<li>ZFC proves existence by a maximality argument; the exact choice strength is weaker than full AC.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-almost-disjoint","status":"resolved","id":"168a305dd3d267bf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-almost-disjoint]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-almost-disjoint","status":"resolved","id":"168a305dd3d267bf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AlmostDisjoint}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-almost-disjoint]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AlmostDisjoint}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MADFamily}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mad-family}\\vdash\\mathrm{MADFamily}_S(\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal A\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\neq B\\to\\mathrm{AlmostDisjoint}_S(A,B))\\land\\forall X\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\exists A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\neg\\mathrm{AlmostDisjoint}_S(A,X)","display":true}],"bytes":1044,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-305","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-mad-family]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-808","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-mad-family.md|58-df-mad-family]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["168a305dd3d267bf"]}